Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:37.72,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&E8ECED\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}勇者ヒンメルの自伝の話以外
