Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.31,0:18:40.72,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord2.5\blur0.7\3c&333333\4c&333333}其他什麼都沒留下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:40.72,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord2.5\blur0.7\3c&333333\4c&333333}何にも残っちゃいない
