Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:52.99,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord1.5\blur0.7}{\3c&60694C\4c&60694C}大きな書庫だな
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.53,0:18:54.86,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&ffffff\bord1.5\blur0.7}{\3c&60694C\4c&60694C}還有欣梅爾先生的雕像
